1
00:00:02,563 --> 00:00:06,900
Water, earth,

2
00:00:06,985 --> 00:00:10,279
fire, air...

3
00:00:11,406 --> 00:00:15,450
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

4
00:00:15,535 --> 00:00:18,829
Then everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

5
00:00:19,872 --> 00:00:23,792
Only the Avatar, master of all
four elements, could stop them.

6
00:00:23,876 --> 00:00:25,711
But when the world needed him most,

7
00:00:25,795 --> 00:00:27,087
he vanished.

8
00:00:27,505 --> 00:00:31,300
A hundred years passed, and my brother
and I discovered the new Avatar,

9
00:00:31,384 --> 00:00:32,968
an airbender named Aang.

10
00:00:33,052 --> 00:00:35,345
And although his
airbending skills are great,

11
00:00:35,430 --> 00:00:38,098
he has a lot to learn
before he's ready to save anyone.

12
00:00:39,058 --> 00:00:42,352
But I believe Aang can save the world.

13
00:00:57,952 --> 00:00:59,494
I'm not one to complain,

14
00:00:59,704 --> 00:01:02,039
but can't Appa fly any higher?

15
00:01:04,083 --> 00:01:05,500
I have an idea.

16
00:01:05,585 --> 00:01:07,127
Why don't we all get on your back,

17
00:01:07,337 --> 00:01:08,879
and you can fly us to the North Pole.

18
00:01:09,088 --> 00:01:10,422
I'd love to.

19
00:01:10,631 --> 00:01:12,132
Climb on, everyone.

20
00:01:12,216 --> 00:01:14,343
Sokka is ready for takeoff.

21
00:01:16,679 --> 00:01:19,181
Look, we're all just a little tired
and cranky

22
00:01:19,265 --> 00:01:21,350
because we've been flying
for two days straight.

23
00:01:21,559 --> 00:01:22,768
And for what?

24
00:01:22,852 --> 00:01:24,561
We can't even find
the Northern Water Tribe.

25
00:01:24,937 --> 00:01:26,563
There's nothing up here.

26
00:01:29,650 --> 00:01:30,734
Aagh!

27
00:01:44,374 --> 00:01:45,582
They're water benders.

28
00:01:45,792 --> 00:01:47,084
We found the Water Tribe.

29
00:01:51,881 --> 00:01:53,131
He's heading north.

30
00:01:53,216 --> 00:01:55,467
The Northern Water Tribe.

31
00:01:55,676 --> 00:01:58,428
The Avatar
needs to master waterbending.

32
00:01:58,638 --> 00:02:00,514
He is looking for a teacher.

33
00:02:00,765 --> 00:02:03,225
Then what are we waiting for?
Let's go get him.

34
00:02:03,434 --> 00:02:05,644
Patience, Captain Li.

35
00:02:05,728 --> 00:02:07,104
This isn't some little earth village

36
00:02:07,188 --> 00:02:09,189
we can just march into.

37
00:02:09,273 --> 00:02:11,274
The Water Tribe is a great nation.

38
00:02:11,484 --> 00:02:14,945
There's a reason they've survived
100 years of war.

39
00:02:15,029 --> 00:02:16,488
The frozen tundra is treacherous.

40
00:02:16,572 --> 00:02:18,865
The landscape itself
is an icy fortress.

41
00:02:19,784 --> 00:02:22,536
We'll need a massive invasion force.

42
00:02:26,290 --> 00:02:27,290
There it is!

43
00:02:28,584 --> 00:02:31,044
The Northern Water Tribe.

44
00:02:31,254 --> 00:02:32,337
We're finally here.

45
00:02:54,444 --> 00:02:56,862
I can't believe
how many waterbenders live up here.

46
00:02:56,988 --> 00:02:59,406
We'll find a master
to teach us no problem.

47
00:03:40,323 --> 00:03:42,657
This place is beautiful.

48
00:03:42,742 --> 00:03:44,034
Yeah.

49
00:03:44,118 --> 00:03:45,494
She is.

50
00:03:57,924 --> 00:04:00,509
Winter, spring

51
00:04:00,593 --> 00:04:02,969
Summer and fall

52
00:04:03,179 --> 00:04:05,680
Winter, spring

53
00:04:05,765 --> 00:04:08,808
Summer and fall

54
00:04:08,893 --> 00:04:11,436
Four seasons

55
00:04:11,646 --> 00:04:14,231
Four loves

56
00:04:14,315 --> 00:04:17,192
Four seasons

57
00:04:17,276 --> 00:04:19,903
For love

58
00:04:41,759 --> 00:04:44,594
Tonight, we celebrate the arrival

59
00:04:44,679 --> 00:04:46,555
of our brother and sister

60
00:04:46,639 --> 00:04:48,223
from the Southern Tribe.

61
00:04:48,641 --> 00:04:52,018
And they have brought with them
someone very special,

62
00:04:52,228 --> 00:04:54,020
someone who many of us believed

63
00:04:54,230 --> 00:04:57,524
disappeared from the world
until now...

64
00:04:57,608 --> 00:04:59,150
The Avatar.

65
00:05:02,989 --> 00:05:07,701
We also celebrate
my daughter's 16th birthday.

66
00:05:07,785 --> 00:05:11,496
Princess Yue is now of marrying age.

67
00:05:12,123 --> 00:05:13,540
Thank you, Father.

68
00:05:13,624 --> 00:05:15,333
May the great Ocean and Moon Spirits

69
00:05:15,418 --> 00:05:17,752
watch over us
during these troubled times.

70
00:05:18,421 --> 00:05:22,632
Now, Master Pakku
and his students will perform!

71
00:05:42,987 --> 00:05:45,280
Hi there. Sokka, Southern Water Tribe.

72
00:05:45,489 --> 00:05:46,781
Very nice to meet you.

73
00:05:49,201 --> 00:05:51,536
So...

74
00:05:52,330 --> 00:05:54,414
You're a princess?

75
00:05:54,498 --> 00:05:57,834
You know, back in my tribe,
I'm kind of like a prince myself.

76
00:05:57,918 --> 00:05:59,961
Ha! The prince of what?

77
00:06:00,046 --> 00:06:01,296
A lot of things!

78
00:06:01,380 --> 00:06:03,757
Do you mind? I'm trying
to have a conversation here.

79
00:06:03,841 --> 00:06:05,967
My apologies, Prince Sokka.

80
00:06:07,928 --> 00:06:10,597
So, it looks like
I'm gonna be in town for a while.

81
00:06:10,681 --> 00:06:12,599
I'm thinking maybe we could...

82
00:06:12,808 --> 00:06:14,768
Do an activity together?

83
00:06:15,144 --> 00:06:16,561
Do an activity?

84
00:06:21,400 --> 00:06:22,776
Very smooth.

85
00:06:23,069 --> 00:06:24,486
Master Pakku,

86
00:06:24,612 --> 00:06:26,613
meet your newest student:

87
00:06:26,697 --> 00:06:27,906
the Avatar.

88
00:06:28,074 --> 00:06:30,659
Just because
you're destined to save the world,

89
00:06:30,868 --> 00:06:33,119
don't expect any special treatment.

90
00:06:34,413 --> 00:06:37,290
My friend and I can't wait
to start training with you...

91
00:06:37,375 --> 00:06:39,334
After we relax for a couple of days.

92
00:06:39,543 --> 00:06:40,960
If you want to relax,

93
00:06:41,170 --> 00:06:43,254
then I suggest
visiting a tropical island.

94
00:06:43,464 --> 00:06:46,341
If not, I'll see you both at sunrise.

95
00:06:46,550 --> 00:06:47,801
Good night.

96
00:06:53,641 --> 00:06:56,351
For the last time,
I'm not playing the sungi horn.

97
00:06:56,435 --> 00:06:58,603
No, it's about our plans.

98
00:06:58,688 --> 00:07:00,647
There is a bit of a problem.

99
00:07:04,318 --> 00:07:05,902
I'm taking your crew.

100
00:07:05,986 --> 00:07:06,986
What?

101
00:07:07,196 --> 00:07:09,030
I've recruited them
for a little expedition

102
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:10,573
to the North Pole.

103
00:07:10,658 --> 00:07:12,117
Uncle, is that true?

104
00:07:12,326 --> 00:07:13,660
I'm afraid so.

105
00:07:13,869 --> 00:07:15,453
He's taking everyone...

106
00:07:15,663 --> 00:07:17,247
Even the cook.

107
00:07:17,331 --> 00:07:18,957
Sorry you won't be there

108
00:07:19,041 --> 00:07:20,834
to watch me capture the Avatar,

109
00:07:21,043 --> 00:07:24,421
but I can't have you
getting in my way again.

110
00:07:24,505 --> 00:07:26,172
No!

111
00:07:42,982 --> 00:07:46,317
I didn't know you were skilled
with broadswords, Prince Zuko.

112
00:07:46,402 --> 00:07:47,694
I'm not.

113
00:07:47,903 --> 00:07:49,404
They're antiques.

114
00:07:49,488 --> 00:07:51,114
Just decorative.

115
00:07:51,198 --> 00:07:54,117
Have you heard of the Blue Spirit,
General Iroh?

116
00:07:54,201 --> 00:07:55,535
Just rumors.

117
00:07:55,745 --> 00:07:57,412
I don't think he is real.

118
00:07:57,621 --> 00:07:59,289
He's real, all right.

119
00:07:59,373 --> 00:08:00,582
He's a criminal

120
00:08:00,666 --> 00:08:02,625
and an enemy of the Fire Nation.

121
00:08:02,710 --> 00:08:06,254
But I have a feeling justice
will catch up with him soon.

122
00:08:06,338 --> 00:08:09,716
General Iroh, the offer
to join my mission still stands...

123
00:08:09,925 --> 00:08:11,342
If you change your mind.

124
00:08:16,348 --> 00:08:18,600
I've waited for this day
my whole life.

125
00:08:18,934 --> 00:08:22,395
I finally get to learn from
a real waterbending master!

126
00:08:25,399 --> 00:08:27,150
Good morning, Master Pakku!

127
00:08:27,234 --> 00:08:28,902
No, please! March right in!

128
00:08:28,986 --> 00:08:31,070
I'm not concentrating or anything.

129
00:08:31,363 --> 00:08:33,531
This is my friend... Katara...

130
00:08:33,699 --> 00:08:34,949
The one I told you about.

131
00:08:36,577 --> 00:08:37,702
I'm sorry.

132
00:08:37,787 --> 00:08:39,871
I think there's been
a misunderstanding.

133
00:08:39,955 --> 00:08:42,165
You didn't tell me
your friend was a girl.

134
00:08:42,458 --> 00:08:44,417
In our tribe, it is forbidden

135
00:08:44,502 --> 00:08:46,961
for women to learn waterbending.

136
00:08:55,179 --> 00:08:57,096
What do you mean, you won't teach me?

137
00:08:57,389 --> 00:08:59,098
I didn't travel
across the entire world

138
00:08:59,308 --> 00:09:00,725
so you could tell me no!

139
00:09:01,018 --> 00:09:02,143
No.

140
00:09:02,228 --> 00:09:04,103
But there must be
other female waterbenders

141
00:09:04,188 --> 00:09:05,230
in your tribe.

142
00:09:05,356 --> 00:09:07,398
Here, the women learn from Yagoda

143
00:09:07,483 --> 00:09:09,359
to use their waterbending to heal.

144
00:09:09,568 --> 00:09:11,319
I'm sure she would be
happy to take you

145
00:09:11,403 --> 00:09:12,737
as her student...

146
00:09:12,947 --> 00:09:14,364
Despite your bad attitude.

147
00:09:14,448 --> 00:09:16,574
I don't want to heal. I want to fight!

148
00:09:16,742 --> 00:09:18,201
I can see that.

149
00:09:18,327 --> 00:09:20,870
But our tribe has customs, rules.

150
00:09:20,955 --> 00:09:22,121
Well, your rules stink!

151
00:09:22,206 --> 00:09:23,373
Yeah!

152
00:09:23,457 --> 00:09:24,624
They're not fair.

153
00:09:24,708 --> 00:09:26,459
If you won't teach Katara, then...

154
00:09:26,544 --> 00:09:27,544
Then what?

155
00:09:28,045 --> 00:09:29,629
Then I won't learn from you!

156
00:09:29,713 --> 00:09:31,881
Well, have fun teaching yourself.

157
00:09:31,966 --> 00:09:33,842
I'm sure you'll do a great job.

158
00:09:33,926 --> 00:09:34,926
Wait!

159
00:09:35,010 --> 00:09:36,886
Aang didn't mean that.

160
00:09:37,972 --> 00:09:39,848
You can't risk your training for me.

161
00:09:39,932 --> 00:09:41,766
You have to learn from Master Pakku,

162
00:09:41,976 --> 00:09:44,143
even if he is a big jerk.

163
00:09:47,606 --> 00:09:49,107
Why don't we get started, then.

164
00:09:51,944 --> 00:09:54,654
Princess Yue, good morning!

165
00:09:56,031 --> 00:09:58,283
Hey, how about that picnic last night?

166
00:09:58,367 --> 00:10:00,910
Boy, your dad sure knows
how to throw a party.

167
00:10:00,995 --> 00:10:02,579
I'm happy you enjoyed yourself.

168
00:10:02,913 --> 00:10:05,039
Well, it wasn't as much fun
after you left.

169
00:10:07,543 --> 00:10:10,378
So, I'm still hoping
we can see more of each other.

170
00:10:10,588 --> 00:10:12,589
Do an activity, you mean?

171
00:10:12,673 --> 00:10:15,341
Yes, at a place...

172
00:10:15,426 --> 00:10:16,801
For some time.

173
00:10:16,886 --> 00:10:18,052
I'd love to.

174
00:10:18,137 --> 00:10:20,096
I'll meet you on that bridge tonight.

175
00:10:20,306 --> 00:10:21,514
Great! I'll see you...

176
00:10:21,599 --> 00:10:23,099
Aagh!

177
00:10:23,309 --> 00:10:25,184
Sorry.

178
00:10:26,353 --> 00:10:28,104
That's ok. It was worth it.

179
00:10:29,273 --> 00:10:31,190
See you tonight.

180
00:10:31,483 --> 00:10:33,151
I'm very impressed.

181
00:10:33,485 --> 00:10:35,820
You all seem highly qualified

182
00:10:36,030 --> 00:10:38,156
for the mission I have in mind.

183
00:10:40,367 --> 00:10:42,243
That's some tasty gold.

184
00:10:43,454 --> 00:10:45,204
What do you need us to do?

185
00:10:45,456 --> 00:10:48,499
I believe you're acquainted
with Prince Zuko.

186
00:10:56,592 --> 00:10:57,967
Um, hi.

187
00:10:58,052 --> 00:10:59,052
Are you Yagoda?

188
00:10:59,595 --> 00:11:01,179
Are you here for the healing lesson?

189
00:11:05,851 --> 00:11:07,101
I guess I am.

190
00:11:07,186 --> 00:11:09,979
Welcome!

191
00:11:15,945 --> 00:11:17,862
You're moving the water around,

192
00:11:17,947 --> 00:11:20,865
but you're not feeling
the push and pull.

193
00:11:21,075 --> 00:11:22,533
I'm trying.

194
00:11:25,955 --> 00:11:27,830
Maybe that move
is too advanced for you.

195
00:11:27,915 --> 00:11:29,874
Why don't you try an easier one?

196
00:11:35,631 --> 00:11:37,465
Thanks for the lesson.

197
00:11:37,549 --> 00:11:39,092
So, who's the lucky boy?

198
00:11:40,260 --> 00:11:41,594
Your betrothal necklace.

199
00:11:41,679 --> 00:11:44,013
You're getting married, right?

200
00:11:44,098 --> 00:11:45,223
No.

201
00:11:45,307 --> 00:11:47,350
I don't think I'm ready for that yet.

202
00:11:47,434 --> 00:11:49,435
My grandmother
gave my mother this necklace,

203
00:11:49,520 --> 00:11:51,396
and my mother passed it down to me.

204
00:11:52,648 --> 00:11:55,525
I recognize this carving!

205
00:11:55,609 --> 00:11:58,111
I don't know
why I didn't realize sooner.

206
00:11:58,320 --> 00:12:00,196
You're the spitting image of Kanna.

207
00:12:00,364 --> 00:12:01,489
Wait!

208
00:12:01,573 --> 00:12:03,533
How do you know my gran-gran's name?

209
00:12:03,867 --> 00:12:06,035
When I was about your age,

210
00:12:06,120 --> 00:12:07,662
I was friends with Kanna.

211
00:12:07,871 --> 00:12:09,580
She was born here...

212
00:12:09,665 --> 00:12:11,124
In the Northern Tribe.

213
00:12:11,208 --> 00:12:12,875
She never told me.

214
00:12:12,960 --> 00:12:15,086
Your grandmother
had an arranged marriage

215
00:12:15,170 --> 00:12:16,671
with a young waterbender.

216
00:12:16,880 --> 00:12:18,923
He carved that necklace for her.

217
00:12:19,133 --> 00:12:22,176
If gran-gran was engaged,
why did she leave?

218
00:12:22,261 --> 00:12:23,761
I don't know.

219
00:12:23,887 --> 00:12:25,805
That's always been a mystery to me.

220
00:12:26,015 --> 00:12:29,225
She left without saying good-bye.

221
00:12:29,518 --> 00:12:31,352
Good luck!

222
00:12:33,272 --> 00:12:36,065
The crew wanted me
to wish you safe travels.

223
00:12:36,150 --> 00:12:38,109
Good riddance to those traitors.

224
00:12:38,318 --> 00:12:40,236
It's a lovely night for a walk.

225
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:42,113
Why don't you join me?

226
00:12:42,197 --> 00:12:44,073
It would clear your head.

227
00:12:46,410 --> 00:12:48,369
Or just stay in your room

228
00:12:48,454 --> 00:12:50,288
and sit in the dark.

229
00:12:50,372 --> 00:12:52,206
Whatever makes you happy.

230
00:13:18,734 --> 00:13:19,817
Whoa!

231
00:13:19,985 --> 00:13:21,944
Careful with the blasting jelly.

232
00:13:24,448 --> 00:13:25,448
Ooh!

233
00:13:26,658 --> 00:13:27,867
Uncle?

234
00:13:28,077 --> 00:13:29,452
Uncle, is that you?

235
00:13:59,608 --> 00:14:00,608
Aah!

236
00:14:12,496 --> 00:14:13,496
Zuko!

237
00:14:22,047 --> 00:14:23,631
Zuko.

238
00:14:34,685 --> 00:14:36,519
Hi, Princess Yue.

239
00:14:36,603 --> 00:14:38,271
I made you something.

240
00:14:38,355 --> 00:14:39,647
I carved it myself.

241
00:14:40,315 --> 00:14:41,566
It's a bear.

242
00:14:41,650 --> 00:14:44,443
Actually, it's supposed to be a fish.

243
00:14:44,528 --> 00:14:46,362
See, it has a fin.

244
00:14:48,490 --> 00:14:51,367
I'm sorry. I made a mistake.

245
00:14:51,577 --> 00:14:53,494
I shouldn't have
asked you to come here.

246
00:15:01,587 --> 00:15:03,045
How's warrior training going?

247
00:15:04,715 --> 00:15:05,965
That bad?

248
00:15:06,175 --> 00:15:07,967
No, it's Princess Yue.

249
00:15:08,051 --> 00:15:09,218
I don't get it.

250
00:15:09,303 --> 00:15:10,636
One minute,
she wants to go out with me,

251
00:15:10,721 --> 00:15:12,180
and the next,
she's telling me to get lost.

252
00:15:13,098 --> 00:15:15,099
So, how's waterbending training?

253
00:15:15,309 --> 00:15:19,103
Master Poop-head won't teach her
because she's a girl.

254
00:15:19,313 --> 00:15:21,439
Why don't you just teach her, Aang?

255
00:15:21,899 --> 00:15:23,733
Why didn't I think of that?

256
00:15:24,151 --> 00:15:25,443
At night, you can teach me

257
00:15:25,527 --> 00:15:27,653
whatever moves
you learn from Master Pakku.

258
00:15:27,738 --> 00:15:29,405
That way,
you have someone to practice with,

259
00:15:29,489 --> 00:15:31,032
and I get to learn waterbending.

260
00:15:31,116 --> 00:15:32,867
Everyone's happy!

261
00:15:32,951 --> 00:15:34,243
I'm not happy.

262
00:15:34,328 --> 00:15:35,453
But you're never happy.

263
00:15:35,537 --> 00:15:36,787
Come on, Aang.

264
00:15:41,919 --> 00:15:43,211
Master Pakku said this move

265
00:15:43,295 --> 00:15:46,339
is all about sinking and floating.

266
00:15:48,383 --> 00:15:49,383
I got it!

267
00:15:51,178 --> 00:15:52,470
That was amazing!

268
00:15:52,679 --> 00:15:53,804
That wasn't me.

269
00:15:56,058 --> 00:15:58,392
I was just showing Katara a few moves.

270
00:15:58,560 --> 00:16:00,061
You have disrespected me,

271
00:16:00,145 --> 00:16:02,647
my teachings, and my entire culture.

272
00:16:02,731 --> 00:16:03,773
I'm sorry, I...

273
00:16:03,857 --> 00:16:07,568
You are no longer welcome
as my student.

274
00:16:14,743 --> 00:16:16,327
What do you want me to do?

275
00:16:16,411 --> 00:16:18,871
Force Master Pakku to take Aang back

276
00:16:18,956 --> 00:16:19,997
as his student?

277
00:16:20,082 --> 00:16:22,041
Yes. Please.

278
00:16:22,125 --> 00:16:24,919
I suspect he might change his mind

279
00:16:25,003 --> 00:16:28,547
if you swallow your pride
and apologize to him.

280
00:16:32,427 --> 00:16:33,427
Fine.

281
00:16:34,179 --> 00:16:35,930
I'm waiting, little girl.

282
00:16:36,848 --> 00:16:38,015
No!

283
00:16:38,100 --> 00:16:41,560
No way am I apologizing
to a sour old man like you!

284
00:16:43,438 --> 00:16:44,605
Katara...

285
00:16:44,690 --> 00:16:46,983
I'll be outside
if you're man enough to fight me.

286
00:16:51,697 --> 00:16:53,364
I'm sure she didn't mean that.

287
00:16:53,448 --> 00:16:55,032
Yeah, I think she did.

288
00:16:57,035 --> 00:17:00,288
I'm devastated
to hear about Prince Zuko.

289
00:17:00,497 --> 00:17:02,373
Just devastated.

290
00:17:03,083 --> 00:17:05,001
The Fire Lord will not be pleased

291
00:17:05,210 --> 00:17:07,795
when he learns who was responsible.

292
00:17:08,005 --> 00:17:10,589
You know who was behind the attack?

293
00:17:11,091 --> 00:17:13,634
Yes. Pirates.

294
00:17:14,261 --> 00:17:16,637
We had a run-in with them
a while back.

295
00:17:16,763 --> 00:17:18,514
They wanted revenge.

296
00:17:20,684 --> 00:17:23,394
So, have you reconsidered my offer?

297
00:17:23,895 --> 00:17:25,563
Yes, I accept.

298
00:17:26,106 --> 00:17:29,108
It will be an honor
to serve as your general.

299
00:17:29,943 --> 00:17:31,527
To the Fire Nation.

300
00:17:31,611 --> 00:17:32,820
To victory!

301
00:17:36,491 --> 00:17:37,783
Are you crazy, Katara?

302
00:17:37,868 --> 00:17:39,744
You're not gonna win this fight.

303
00:17:39,953 --> 00:17:41,620
I know. I don't care.

304
00:17:41,705 --> 00:17:43,331
You don't have to do this for me.

305
00:17:43,415 --> 00:17:44,874
I can find another teacher.

306
00:17:44,958 --> 00:17:46,709
I'm not doing it for you.

307
00:17:46,793 --> 00:17:49,253
Someone needs to
slap some sense into that guy.

308
00:17:50,255 --> 00:17:52,214
So, you decided to show up?

309
00:17:55,886 --> 00:17:56,886
Aren't you gonna fight?

310
00:17:57,220 --> 00:17:58,637
Go back to the healing huts

311
00:17:58,722 --> 00:18:00,431
with the other women,
where you belong.

312
00:18:05,020 --> 00:18:06,187
Fine.

313
00:18:06,271 --> 00:18:07,813
You want to learn to fight so bad,

314
00:18:07,898 --> 00:18:09,315
study closely.

315
00:18:19,785 --> 00:18:21,285
Don't worry.
I'm not going to hurt you.

316
00:18:40,514 --> 00:18:42,598
You can't knock me down!

317
00:18:42,682 --> 00:18:44,100
Go, Katara!

318
00:19:25,600 --> 00:19:27,476
Well, I'm impressed.

319
00:19:27,561 --> 00:19:29,979
You are an excellent waterbender.

320
00:19:30,063 --> 00:19:32,148
But you still won't teach me,
will you?

321
00:19:32,232 --> 00:19:33,482
No.

322
00:19:58,216 --> 00:19:59,884
This fight is over.

323
00:20:00,260 --> 00:20:02,428
Come back here. I'm not finished yet.

324
00:20:02,512 --> 00:20:04,263
Yes. You are.

325
00:20:06,600 --> 00:20:09,185
This is my necklace.

326
00:20:09,352 --> 00:20:11,979
No, it's not. It's mine. Give it back!

327
00:20:12,063 --> 00:20:14,523
I made this 60 years ago...

328
00:20:14,733 --> 00:20:17,234
For the love of my life...

329
00:20:17,444 --> 00:20:18,569
For Kanna.

330
00:20:19,029 --> 00:20:21,655
My gran-gran
was supposed to marry you?

331
00:20:27,537 --> 00:20:29,788
Our plan is working perfectly.

332
00:20:29,998 --> 00:20:32,249
Zhao doesn't suspect a thing.

333
00:20:33,210 --> 00:20:34,668
You didn't have to do this.

334
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:38,214
No nephew of mine
is going to stow away on a ship

335
00:20:38,298 --> 00:20:39,548
without some backup.

336
00:20:39,758 --> 00:20:40,883
Thank you, Uncle.

337
00:20:42,135 --> 00:20:43,594
Someone's coming.

338
00:20:44,054 --> 00:20:46,639
Stay hidden
until we get to the North Pole

339
00:20:46,723 --> 00:20:48,974
and the Avatar will be yours.

340
00:20:49,059 --> 00:20:50,476
Good luck.

341
00:20:53,355 --> 00:20:55,397
I carved this necklace
for your grandmother

342
00:20:55,482 --> 00:20:57,399
when we got engaged.

343
00:20:57,484 --> 00:21:01,195
I thought we would have
a long happy life together.

344
00:21:01,279 --> 00:21:02,696
I loved her.

345
00:21:02,781 --> 00:21:04,698
But she didn't love you, did she?

346
00:21:04,824 --> 00:21:06,617
It was an arranged marriage.

347
00:21:07,869 --> 00:21:11,664
Gran-gran wouldn't let your tribe's
stupid customs run her life.

348
00:21:11,873 --> 00:21:13,415
That's why she left.

349
00:21:13,625 --> 00:21:15,543
It must have taken a lot of courage.

350
00:21:18,129 --> 00:21:19,255
Go get her.

351
00:21:26,972 --> 00:21:28,514
What do you want from me?

352
00:21:28,848 --> 00:21:29,890
Nothing.

353
00:21:29,975 --> 00:21:32,893
I just want you to know
I think you're beautiful.

354
00:21:32,978 --> 00:21:35,980
And I never thought a girl like you
would even notice a guy like me.

355
00:21:36,064 --> 00:21:37,565
You don't understand.

356
00:21:37,774 --> 00:21:38,899
No, no.

357
00:21:38,984 --> 00:21:40,401
See, that's the thing.

358
00:21:40,485 --> 00:21:42,111
I think I do understand now.

359
00:21:42,320 --> 00:21:44,697
You're a princess, and I'm...

360
00:21:44,781 --> 00:21:46,282
I'm just a southern peasant.

361
00:21:46,491 --> 00:21:48,033
No, Sokka.

362
00:21:48,243 --> 00:21:49,368
It's ok.

363
00:21:49,452 --> 00:21:50,828
You don't have to say anything.

364
00:21:51,580 --> 00:21:52,705
I'll see you around, ok.

365
00:21:56,501 --> 00:21:59,336
Ok, now I'm really confused!

366
00:21:59,546 --> 00:22:02,214
Happy, but confused.

367
00:22:02,299 --> 00:22:04,758
I do like you... A lot!

368
00:22:04,843 --> 00:22:06,552
But we can't be together.

369
00:22:06,636 --> 00:22:08,721
And not for the reason you think.

370
00:22:09,306 --> 00:22:11,265
It's because...

371
00:22:11,349 --> 00:22:12,975
I'm engaged.

372
00:22:14,686 --> 00:22:16,145
I'm sorry.

373
00:22:26,531 --> 00:22:28,282
Not bad. Not bad.

374
00:22:28,366 --> 00:22:29,450
Ha ha ha ha.

375
00:22:29,534 --> 00:22:31,076
Keep practicing,
and maybe you'll get it

376
00:22:31,161 --> 00:22:32,995
by the time you're my age.

377
00:22:35,415 --> 00:22:36,707
Hey, Katara.

378
00:22:36,791 --> 00:22:38,167
What do you think you're doing?

379
00:22:38,752 --> 00:22:40,419
It's past sunrise.

380
00:22:40,503 --> 00:22:42,046
You're late.

381
00:22:42,797 --> 00:22:44,048
Good to see you here.

382
00:22:44,174 --> 00:22:45,299
You, too.

383
00:22:53,642 --> 00:22:55,559
My fleet is ready.

384
00:22:55,810 --> 00:22:58,604
Set a course
for the Northern Water Tribe.
